From 6d708850bcaa2ab4e058136664e6c5069d157b72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:58:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 170/180] hydra: Cycles Render Settings LOP, Cycles (Setup)
 tool, AOV Auto Fill

- Cycles Render Settings: Karma Render Settings' counterpart. One node
  writes the render settings prim (camera, resolution, the 71 settings of
  the Render Settings LOP's Cycles tab, always authored), the render
  product with its output picture and beauty, and the View Layer passes
  of the Cycles AOVs LOP. Default paths /Render/CyclesRenderSettings and
  /Render/Products/CyclesBeauty, apart from Karma's (K-125).
- Cycles (Setup), Rendering/Cycles in the LOP tab menu: Cycles Render
  Settings, a Render Pass on it and a USD Render ROP on Cycles GPU, as
  Karma (Setup) lays out Karma's.
- Cycles AOVs: Auto Fill buttons add the light groups (Cycles primvar,
  Karma LPE tags on lights and objects) and the AOV Output names the input
  stage uses; each light group and shader AOV has an enable toggle.
- Both nodes carry Blender's icon (see CREDITS.md in the outer repo for
  its terms) and sit under Rendering/Cycles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
